# Retail Sales Performance Dashboard

## Project Overview

This project analyzes Global Superstore sales data using Microsoft Excel.

## Tools Used

* Microsoft Excel
* Pivot Tables
* Pivot Charts
* Slicers

## Key Insights

* Analyzed yearly sales trends.
* Identified top 10 products by sales.
* Compared sales and profit across categories.
* Performed region-wise sales analysis.
* Built an interactive dashboard using slicers.

